                                "text": "На лесопильном заводе близ Моулмейна я впервые в жизни поездил на слоне."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81c71e64-21d9-4a09-8b4b-d34ea7a9f14c",
                                "sense_id": "de1dc0f6-fdca-3615-97d8-a24df89a4240",
                                "text": "Село возникло при лесопильной мельнице, запущенной в 1721 году."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f89ae27-9b5e-471d-9e89-8414bbf663a7",
                                "sense_id": "de1dc0f6-fdca-3615-97d8-a24df89a4240",
                                "text": "Из исторических памятников в Каменке ― кроме пруда и высокой плотины ― деревянное двухэтажное здание конторы пристанского и лесопильного хозяйства."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2fb8f385-db27-4360-b1ba-15f413fde5c5",
                        "source_entry_id": "567b9a19-411d-3c95-bf18-e5a40df16da1",
                        "source_sense_id": "de1dc0f6-fdca-3615-97d8-a24df89a4240",
                        "target_lang_word": "sawmill",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sawmill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                        "entry_id": "5e04e34a-ee8b-3664-a635-163b1f1c4e9b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A machine, building or company used for cutting (milling) lumber, or (rarely) other hard materials such as stone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "754208e8-0878-4528-8c63-c50837ffbee6",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "He brought his portable sawmill and turned the old beams into interesting flooring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "079b845b-688a-4637-bc6d-7992d75a060c",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "The old sawmill still has its waterwheel but they took the saw away years ago."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdf88a4f-46b0-4019-b33f-4f6fe4ae5036",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "The sawmill sells lumber to carpenters and sawdust to gardeners."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd4fdc52-0fda-4da3-8ee6-b560a43660f2",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "When I came to the saw-mill at Brække, the sky was overcast, it was already growing dark, only above the level of the north-western horizon there appeared a streak of light, which threw a subdued glimmer on the tranquil surface of the mill-pond."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c26a931a-3492-4a6c-8f2d-c8cb926a0b58",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "My client welcomed the judge […] and they disappeared together into the Ethiopian card-room, which was filled with the assegais and exclamation point shields Mr. Cooke had had made at the sawmill at Beaverton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
